                "markdown": "**Vulnerability GHSA-xphf-cx8h-7q9g**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|openssl|0.10.60|[GHSA-xphf-cx8h-7q9g](https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-xphf-cx8h-7q9g)|\n\nThis function returned a reference into an OpenSSL datastructure, but there was no way to ensure OpenSSL would not mutate the datastructure behind one's back.\n\nUse of this function should be replaced with `X509StoreRef::all_certificates`.\n"
